== r19_returntwice
  san:    exit 0 run: a Qbc1 b abc1|baked: a Qbc1 b abc1|
  O3:     exit 0 run: a Qbc1 b abc1|baked: a Qbc1 b abc1|
  interp: exit 0 run: a Qbc1 b abc1|baked: a Qbc1 b abc1|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/r19_returntwice.debug.san
--- run san
run: a Qbc1 b abc1
baked: a Qbc1 b abc1
--- run O3
run: a Qbc1 b abc1
baked: a Qbc1 b abc1
--- interpret
run: a Qbc1 b abc1
baked: a Qbc1 b abc1
